<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Proffitt's buy repeated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Proffitt's buy repeated.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Tuesday it reiterated its buy recommendation on Proffitt's Inc.</p>
<p>-- It said Proffitt's first quarter fully diluted earnings excluding charges of $0.41 a share were $0.02 above its estimate.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Proffitt's, a retailer, were off 15/16 at 40-13/16.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
